How it behaves
Triggers on every push by you ( johntjz ) to any file in main ( index.html ,
planner.js , map.js , hardcode.js , worker.js , etc.).
Preserves existing version.json keys (like lastUpdated or tdLastUpdated
written by actions.yml ) while updating version , appUpdated , and commit .
Never loops because both if: github.actor != 'github-actions[bot]' and
[skip ci] prevent github-actions[bot] commits from re-triggering
workflows.
Takes ~8 seconds, after which Cloudflare Pages deploys the stamped
index.html and version.json automatically.
